  "originalText": "For the following exercises, solve the equations.\n\n52. \\(x^{\\frac{3}{2}}=27\\)\n\n53. \\(x^{\\frac{1}{2}}-4 x^{\\frac{1}{4}}=0\\)\n\n54. \\(4 x^{3}+8 x^{2}-9 x-18=0\\)\n\n55. \\(3 x^{5}-6 x^{3}=0\\)\n\n56. \\(\\sqrt{x+9}=x-3\\)\n\n57. \\(\\sqrt{3 x+7}+\\sqrt{x+2}=1\\)\n\n58. \\(|3 x-7|=5\\)\n\n59. \\(|2 x+3|-5=9\\)\n\nThis page titled 2.6.0: Other Types of Equations (Exercises) was last modified on Thu, 26 Dec 2024 22:30:59 GMT and is shared under a CC BY  4.0  license and was authored, remixed, and/or curated by OpenStax via source content that was edited to the style and standards of the LibreTexts platform.",
